OL,3,GNEWSAPolice issue disorder warning
OL,4,Abefore FA Trophy tie
OL,5,
OL,6,FExtra patrols and increased police
OL,7,Fpowers will be in force as Halesowen
OL,8,FTown and Redditch United clash in the
OL,9,FFA Trophy on Saturday.
OL,11,FWest Midlands Police said it had
OL,12,Freceived information that groups of
OL,13,Fyouths may want to use the fixture as a
OL,14,F"pretext to engage in violence and
OL,15,Fdisorder".
OL,17,FIn response, the force will use Section
OL,18,F60 powers from 10:00 to 22:00 GMT
OL,19,Faround Halesowen, which gives officers
OL,20,Fthe ability to stop and search people
OL,21,Fwithout the need to have reasonable
OL,22,Fgrounds.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
